<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Brash to give speech at 11.00 a.m.</title>
<headline>NZ's Brash to give speech at 11.00 a.m.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Bank Governor Don Brash is to give a speech to Federated Farmers in Invercargill at 11.00 a.m. (2200 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
